cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FHEViT: research code for private chest-radiograph VLM representations"
message: "If this software supports published work, please cite this repository and the relevant upstream datasets and model papers."
type: software
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
authors:
  - family-names: Jiang
    given-names: Luchang
repository-code: "https://github.com/FinalSunFlower/FHEViT"
url: "https://github.com/FinalSunFlower/FHEViT"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Research code for evaluating chest-radiograph visual representations, privacy
  leakage after decryption, and reduced CKKS inference blocks. The software does
  not establish clinical readiness or post-release image privacy.
keywords:
  - fully homomorphic encryption
  - homomorphic encryption
  - CKKS
  - medical imaging
  - chest radiography
  - vision-language models
  - medical vision-language models
  - privacy evaluation
  - representation privacy
  - feature inversion
  - image reconstruction
  - reproducible research
